user.description:
In the Darb app (as an admin): Settings › Devices › Connect Home Assistant › Make Home Assistant code. It looks like ABCDE-FGH23. Enter it and the hub address the app shows.

Or on the hub run `sudo darb-pair --ha` — it prints the same kind of code.

{detail}

